    "text": "By WGNS News ,\n6 hours ago MURFREESBORO, Tenn. – A two-vehicle accident in Murfreesboro on Wednesday around noon resulted in three people being injured. The crash occurred in front of or next to the Yard Sale Store, near the intersection of NW Broad Street and Front Street. Murfreesboro Police Public Information Officer Larry Flowers confirmed the wreck, stating, “We had a crash at Yard Sale on Broad.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
